<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">About HotelCarga</h1>
    <p>HotelCarga is an ASP.NET Core MVC project developed in C# using .NET 10.0. This project demonstrates a basic web application structure with a HomeController that handles the Index and About pages. The application features a responsive layout using Bootstrap for navigation and styling.</p>
    <p>The project includes:</p>
    <ul class="list-unstyled">
        <li>ASP.NET Core MVC framework</li>
        <li>C# programming language</li>
        <li>.NET 10.0 runtime</li>
        <li>Bootstrap for responsive design</li>
        <li>Static file serving</li>
    </ul>
</div>